# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:9218 #-#-# translate crowdin pizza_date_19042f9e:
msgid "[_MT_] {i}Now, a betrayal to his father on the other hand, crap!... [dad_name] didn't even come into my mind! My sex drive just pushed me forward without considering any consequences.{/i}"
