msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Я должен оставаться сильным. Все выглядят в моем направлении. Если посмотрю, поймаю.{/i}"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10493 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_052606cf_1:
msgid "[_J_] If you wanted to pose in one of Ronald's photo shoots..."
msgstr "[_J_] Если вы хотите разместить одну из фотографий Роналда..."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10494 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_78d5e08b_1:
msgid "[_A_] It's [ryan], Uncle."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10495 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_7c84d260_1:
msgid "[_J_] Right, anyways, You would need to clear that with your mom first, because I know my sister, and I know she would kill you, and probably me, if she found those kind of pictures of you online."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10496 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_7d380335:
msgid "[_A_] She seems to have forgotten that I'm an adult now that can make my own decisions."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10497 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_2c959852:
msgid "[_J_] And you seem to have forgotten that being a member of this family comes at the cost of a lot of your personal freedoms."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10500 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_f388b0fb:
msgid "[_J_] But anyways, Ron... I mean [ryan], Your new business intrigues me. There might be some opportunity that the family would be willing to throw some money behind."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10501 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_0b1896e7:
msgid "[_J_] And not the kind of money you have to pay back, just an agreement to share in future profits, or even come to an agreement to forgive certain debts."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10502 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_77bcfc05:
msgid "[_J_] I'd love to talk about it with you when we've got some more time."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10503 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_817dfa4f_1:
msgid "[_R_] Yeah, that sounds... interesting."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10504 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_21038405:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Why in the hell would the DeCapos be interested in my cosplay photo business?{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Почему в ад DeCapos интересуется моим космическим фотобизнесом?{/i}"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10505 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_67c2129e_1:
msgid "[_G_] {i}Uhh... Excuse me boss.{/i}"
msgstr "[_G_] {i}Uhh... Простите меня босса.{/i}"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10508 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_3732e994_1:
msgid "[_J_] Yes, what is it?"
msgstr "[_J_] Да, что это?"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10511 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_6e542087:
msgid "[_G_] I'm sorry to interrupt, but I was wondering if I could borrow Armani and the kid for just a bit?"
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10512 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_edac381a:
msgid "[_R_] I'm an adult, and what do you need me for?"
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10513 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_8f5573bd:
msgid "[_G_] Uhhh... I need some advice from someone who... takes pictures of things, er of girls."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10514 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_aa7f2fd4:
msgid "[_G_] And I need Armani for her... uhh... attention to detail."
msgstr "[_G_] И мне нужен Армани... ах... внимание... подробности."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10515 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_8d3412b2:
msgid "[_J_] Yeah, I think [mom_name] and I will be just fine on our own for a little bit."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10516 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_c0a88b54:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}What is this?... This is so weird!... Why would Joey's goon need advice from me on photography.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Что это?... Это так странно!... Зачем мне хоть как-то советы на фотографии.{/i}"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10517 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_b77d06de_1:
msgid "[_R_] I think I'll just stay here."
msgstr "[_R_] Я думаю, что я просто остаюсь здесь."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10518 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_9e613d7e_1:
msgid "[_M_] [ryan]! Don't be rude! I didn't raise you like that! Go see what he needs. I'm sure Joey wouldn't let you go if there were any danger to you."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10519 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_39425a0a_1:
msgid "[_J_] That's right. I trust my team completely."
msgstr "[_J_] Это правильно. Я доверяю моей команде полностью."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10520 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_7923a8b1:
msgid "[_R_] What about Charlie the Chin?"
msgstr "[_R_] Как насчет Чарли Китай?"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10521 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_39307d7d:
msgid "[_J_] He wasn't one of my made men."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10522 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_0ded8f82:
msgid "[_R_] Uhhh... Fine... But if you want my opinion, this feels a little off."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10528 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_88884fe6:
msgid "[_R_] So, what's so important that you need help with?"
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10529 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_1e5dd0b4:
msgid "[_G_] Nothin."
msgstr "[_G_] Nothin."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10530 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_af5425b8:
msgid "[_G_] I was just told to get rid of you two after the food came in so that the boss can be alone with your mom."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10531 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_9fd3441e:
msgid "[_A_] I fucking knew it."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10532 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_7629920a:
msgid "[_R_] Wait!... What!?"
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10533 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_1be2995a:
msgid "[_R_] Let me back in there!"
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10534 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_0de221bc:
msgid "[_G_] Nothin doing!"
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10535 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_5d7cf0e7:
msgid "[_G_] The boss told me to keep you two out for a half hour, and you're not going in a single minute before."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10536 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_171c38f2:
msgid "[_G_] If you try, I'll break your legs."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10537 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_7ed06001:
msgid "[_G_] You can find comfort in knowing that the boss isn't the kind of guy that will force your mom to do anything against her will."
msgstr "[_G_] Вы можете найти комфорт, зная, что босс не тот парень, который заставляет маму делать что-нибудь против ее воли."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10538 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_6e6a1325:
msgid "[_G_] If your mom does anything you don't like with the boss, just remember it was her choice."
msgstr "[_G_] Если ваша мама делает что-то, что вам не нравится с боссом, просто помните, что это был ее выбор."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10539 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_d2ab1851:
msgid "[_A_] Come on, [ryan]. What's done is done, Let's go find something to do for the next half hour."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10545 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_fa668b4b:
msgid "[_A_] So, this side of the restaurant is where the private dinning rooms are, and these restrooms are for those rooms."
msgstr "[_A_] Таким образом, эта сторона ресторана - это место, где расположены частные столовые комнаты, и эти туалеты предназначены для этих комнат."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10546 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_af9ee080:
msgid "[_A_] At any given time most of those dinning rooms are empty, meaning that almost nobody will be using these bathrooms."
msgstr "[_A_] В любое время большинство столовых комнат пусто, что означает, что почти никто не будет использовать эти ванные комнаты."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10547 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_4b001f17:
msgid "[_R_] That's pretty nice for all those wealthy shy poopers."
msgstr "[_R_] Это очень приятно для всех тех богатых застенчивых покровителей."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10548 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_6820d590:
msgid "[_R_] Are you saying you need to use the bathroom?"
msgstr "[_R_] Вы говорите, что вам нужно использовать ванну?"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10551 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_606a9211:
msgid "[_R_] Uhhh... I think that's the boys room you're going into."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10552 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_286a200c:
msgid "[_A_] I know... I have a feeling you wouldn't follow me into the girls."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10555 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_50ae162e:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Follow her?{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Следуйте за ней?{/i}"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10556 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_47eb3b1e:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Is she serious?{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Она серьезна?{/i}"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10557 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_79bbc32b:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Does she want to mess around? And do I dare do anything with Joey's niece?{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Хочется пойти повсюду? И осмелился ли я что-нибудь сделать с ничьей Джой?{/i}"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10558 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_13429a9e:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}I guess there's only one way to find out.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Я полагаю, что есть только один способ найти.{/i}"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10564 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_d020eaa9_1:
msgid "[_A_] Oh, good! I was starting to worry that maybe you wouldn't follow."
msgstr "О, хорошо! Я начинаю волноваться, что, может быть, ты не последуешь."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10567 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_f21560c0_1:
msgid "[_A_] I'm so glad you did though!"
msgstr "Я так рада, что ты сделал это!"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10568 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_c7f25f8d_1:
msgid "[_A_] You know..."
msgstr "[ _A_] Вы знаете ..."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10571 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_1bc12156:
msgid "[_A_] I never did get a chance to properly thank you for saving my life."
msgstr "У меня никогда не было возможности должным образом поблагодарить тебя за спасение моей жизни."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10572 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_eef2f352:
msgid "[_A_] Who knows what The Chin would have done to us if you hadn't come when you did."
msgstr "[ _A_] Кто знает, что Чон сделал бы с нами, если бы ты не пришел, когда ты это сделал."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10576 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_c4e8185e:
msgid "[_A_] I mean, he shoved a fucking wrench up Agent Diaz's ass!"
msgstr "[_A_] Я имею в виду, он засунул чертов гаечный ключ в задницу агента Диаса!"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10578 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_0cec3e07:
msgid "[_A_] Diaz said he was about to shove a wrench in her ass before you walked in."
msgstr "[ _A_] Диаз сказал, что он собирается засуненить ей жопу в задницу, пока ты не вошла."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10579 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_fb3624d6:
msgid "[_A_] I don't even want to think about what would have happened if he had more time."
msgstr "[ _A_] Я даже не хочу думать о том, что бы случилось, если бы у него было больше времени."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10582 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_34804079:
msgid "[_A_] And I know Sidney took your v-card to properly thank you for saving us, and while I'm not ready to have sex with you..."
msgstr "[_A_] И я знаю, Sidney взял вашу V-карту, чтобы правильно поблагодарить вас за спасение, и, пока я не готов к сексу с вами..."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10585 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_a741448d:
msgid "[_A_] Maybe we could mess around?"
msgstr "Может, мы могли бы перепутаться?"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10586 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_a0a161a3:
msgid "[_R_] Normally I'd be all about that, but for all I know, your uncle is fucking my mom just down the hall."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10589 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_5b2f8cb0:
msgid "[_A_] Is your mom that easy?"
msgstr "[_A_] Твоя мама легко?"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10590 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_d6797e6b:
msgid "[_A_] Besides, why do you care so much?"
msgstr "[_A_] Кроме того, почему вам так нравится?"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10591 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_dc7a84b6_1:
msgid "[_R_] ...."
msgstr "[_R_] ...."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10594 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_1931d5dc:
msgid "[_A_] Oh, my God!"
msgstr "Боже мой!"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10595 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_04c3fadc:
msgid "[_A_] You have the hots for her too, don't you?"
msgstr "[_A_] У тебя тоже есть жары, не так ли?"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10596 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_24cd4896:
msgid "[_R_] No, I..."
msgstr "Нет, я ..."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10597 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_48f6e799:
msgid "[_A_] You are so much more depraved than I gave you credit for."
msgstr "[_A_] Вы гораздо более глубины, чем я дал вам кредит."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10598 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_a096e0cc:
msgid "[_R_] Uhhh... Yes, fine... You already know about Sidney and I, so I guess you knowing that I have the hots for my mom doesn't make much of a difference."
msgstr "[ _R_] Uhhh ... Да, хорошо ... Ты уже знаешь о Сидни и я, так что, я думаю, ты знаешь, что у меня есть копыта для моей мамы, не имеет большого значения."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10599 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_4a498945:
msgid "[_R_] You must think I'm disgusting."
msgstr "Ты должен думать, что я отвратительный."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10602 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_83e5ad47:
msgid "[_A_] You'd think so, but no... I kinda grew up being used to the idea."
msgstr "[ _A_] Вы так думаете, но нет ... Я вроде как вырос, привык к идее."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10603 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_efe6a722:
msgid "[_A_] You see, our family is from the old country, and before we fled there, we were part of the royalty."
msgstr "[ _A_] Видите, наша семья из старой страны, и до того, как мы бежали туда, мы были частью роялти."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10604 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_acbfa4b9:
msgid "[_A_] We actually are direct descendants of the Borgias, if you've ever heard of them."
msgstr "[ _A_] Мы, вообще-то, прямые потомки Борджиа, если вы когда-либо слышали о них."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10605 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_6c095719:
msgid "[_R_] Yeah. I think I've played a video game where they were the bad guys."
msgstr "[ _R_] Да. Думаю, я играл в видеоигру, где они были плохими парнями."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10606 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_aaefee17:
msgid "[_A_] Yep, that's them, only we're kinda proud to be their descendants."
msgstr "Да, это они, только мы горды тем, что были их потомками."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10607 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_ff39cb2f:
msgid "[_A_] And our branch has been trying to keep the bloodline pretty pure, so marriage between cousins, and sometimes even closer relations, is pretty common in our family."
msgstr "[ _A_] И наша ветвь старалась держать родословные довольно чистой, так что брак между кузенами, а иногда даже более тесные отношения, довольно распространен в нашей семье."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10610 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_dd6d9b5d:
msgid "[_A_] In fact, the main reason my mom lets me work with my uncle in a strip club, is she's hoping I'll seduce him and bring the ruling branch back under her."
msgstr "На самом деле, главная причина, по которой моя мама позволяет мне работать с дядей в стрип-клубе, она надеется, что я его соблазну и приведу к себе правящую ветвь."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10611 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_3e99c079:
msgid "[_A_] She tried to seduce Joey herself when they were teenagers, but he wasn't interested, so now the pressure's on me."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10614 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_aba8bfab:
msgid "[_A_] So, you see... Not so weird to me."
msgstr "[ _A_] Итак, вы видите ... Не так странно для меня."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10615 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_ca4e3bb8:
msgid "[_R_] So, you understand why I don't want her alone with Joey."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10618 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_51e97920:
msgid "[_A_] If it makes you feel any better, I'm about ninety nine percent positive that Joey won't fuck her in there tonight."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10619 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_018082d4:
msgid "[_A_] He's very cautious, and if there's any chance someone could be watching, listening, filming, or whatever, he won't risk giving someone else the opportunity to blackmail him."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10620 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_506f2736:
msgid "[_A_] So a public place like this. Not likely."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10621 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_66d2597b:
msgid "[_A_] Not saying he won't mess around with her, No one in the criminal underworld would flinch at that, but actual sex is risky."
msgstr "[_A_] Не говорить, что он не будет общаться с ней, никто в преступном подмирился бы на это, но фактический секс рискован."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10622 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_1fd88bfa:
msgid "[_A_] But even if he does. There's nothing you can do about it. His body guard won't let you through that door unless you manage to kill him first."
msgstr "[_A_] Но даже если он и делает. Ничего не может. Его тело не пропускает вас через эту дверь, если вам не удастся убить его."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10623 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_dd706009:
msgid "[_A_] The best thing you can do is keep the score even by having a little fun yourself."
msgstr "[_A_] Лучше всего, что вы можете сделать, это держать счет даже маленьким удовольствием."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10624 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_cdde5e3e:
msgid "[_R_] Hmm... Maybe."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10625 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_ad3641f1:
msgid "[_A_] I sense you're still worried."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10629 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_8fc9df89:
msgid "[_A_] Maybe these can help distract you."
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10630 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_dc7a84b6_2:
msgid "[_R_] ...."
msgstr "[_R_] ...."

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10631 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_5f1e8af6_1:
msgid "[_R_] Wow!"
msgstr "Вау!"

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10634 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_cb2ef32e_1:
msgid "[_R_] What were we talking about?"
msgstr ""

# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:10635 #-#-# translate crowdin sushi_date_joey_fcd1f354_1:
msgid "[_A_] Haha... That's what I like to hear."
msgstr ""

