# game/UpdateScript0.08_2.rpy:12983 #-#-# translate crowdin beach_date_joey_ab2e26f5:
msgid "[_J_] I'm sorry, but all debts have to be paid. If I'm soft on our debtors, my brothers will force me into an early retirement."
